  ($j$qeelasee-3d-clover-lash-black$j$, $j$W shape lashes are ready-made fans where 3 lash fibres are joined at one base and open into a W, so each pick gives an even 3D fan with no hand fanning. These black 3D W lashes are 0.07mm, in C or D curl, with single lengths from 8mm to 15mm or a mixed tray. They are a quick way to do fluffy, textured volume and the popular "W lash" sets.$j$, $j$["3 fibres per fan, W shape", "0.07mm, C and D curl", "8-15mm single lengths or mixed tray", "Black colour"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "3D W Shape Lash Extensions Black 0.07mm | Kenya", "meta": "Black 3D W shape lashes: 3 fibres joined at the base into a ready-made fan. 0.07mm, C or D curl, 8-15mm. Wholesale in Kenya.", "keyword": "3D W lashes", "keywords": ["3D premade fans", "W shape lash extensions Kenya", "3D lashes Kenya", "premade volume lashes", "W lashes"], "alt": "Black 3D W shape lash extensions tray with a close-up of a 3-fibre W fan", "sections": [{"heading": "Why W shape lashes", "body": "The fibres are joined in production, so every fan is the same width and the base is thin and clean. You pick, dip and place, which makes a full 3D set much quicker than hand-made fans and easy to repeat client after client."}, {"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Salons that want fast, consistent volume, newer artists offering volume before they can hand-fan, and anyone doing the trendy wispy W lash look."}, {"heading": "Application tips", "body": "Pick the fan by its base, dip only the base in glue, and place it on one isolated natural lash. Check the fan opens flat and points the same way as its neighbours."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; 