  ($j$qeelasee-as09-volume-tweezers$j$, $j$AS09 is a volume lash tweezer made for picking and opening 3D to 6D fans. It has a sharp, pointed angled tip that closes perfectly along its length, so fans come off the strip evenly. Stainless steel, 11.3cm long.$j$, $j$["For 3D-6D volume fans", "Sharp, precise tip", "Perfect closure", "11.3cm stainless steel"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "AS09 Volume Lash Tweezers for 3D-6D Fans | Kenya", "meta": "AS09 volume tweezers with a sharp angled tip and precise closure for making 3D-6D fans. 11.3cm stainless steel. Wholesale lash tweezers in Kenya.", "keyword": "volume lash tweezers", "keywords": ["AS09 tweezers", "3D 6D volume tweezers", "fanning tweezers", "lash tweezers Kenya", "eyelash extension tweezers"], "alt": "AS09 volume lash tweezers in stainless steel picking up a volume fan", "sections": [{"heading": "Isolation or volume tweezers?", "body": "Isolation tweezers are long and straight or gently curved; you use them in your non-working hand to separate one natural lash. Volume tweezers have angled, L or boot shaped tips that let you pick up and open fans. Most artists keep one isolation tweezer and one or two volume tweezers."}, {"heading": "Caring for your tweezers", "body": "Wipe glue off the tips after every client and disinfect them between clients. Store them with tip covers on, and never drop them: a bent tip stops closing evenly, which ruins isolation and fanning."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange d