0mm only on strong lashes, because a heavy extension can stress a weak natural lash."}, {"q": "Can I use these for hybrid sets?", "a": "Yes. Mix classic lashes from this tray with handmade or premade volume fans to build a hybrid set."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Classic lash extensions tray with black lashes in rows and a close-up of the finished classic set$j$),
  ($j$classic-lashes$j$, $j$A tray of classic lashes for one-to-one lash extensions, packed in neat rows in a clear-lid branded tray. Classic lashes give the clean mascara look most first-time clients ask for, and they are the lash you will reach for on almost every set and fill.$j$, $j$["Classic lashes for one-to-one sets", "Neat rows in a clear-lid tray", "Soft black lashes"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Classic Lashes Tray for Lash Extensions | Kenya", "meta": "Classic lashes tray for one-to-one lash extensions: neat rows of soft black lashes in a branded tray. Order at wholesale prices in Kenya.", "keyword": "classic lashes", "keywords": ["classic lash extensions Kenya", "classic lash tray", "individual lashes for extensions", "lash extension supplies Nairobi", "eyelash extensions price in Kenya"], "alt": "Classic lashes tray with rows of black lash extensions in a clear-lid case beside white flowers", "sections": [{"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Lash technicians doing classic sets and fills, beginners practising one-to-one application, and salons that want a steady classic tray at the station."}, {"heading": "How classic sets work", "body": "Isolate one natural lash, dip the base of the extension in a small bead of glue and place it slightly off the eyelid along the natural lash. One extension per natural lash keeps the set light and safe for the natural lash cycle."}, {"heading": "Before you order", "body": "Tell us the thickness, curl and length you need when you order, or message us and we will help you choose. If you want the full range of thicknesses and curls to pick from on the page, see our Classic Lash trays."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Classic (one-to-one) lash extensions"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Black"}, {"label": "Packaging", "value": "Branded tray with clear lid"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy classic lashes in Kenya?", "a": "Order classic lashes here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is a classic lash tray in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "What is the difference between classic and volume lashes?", "a": "Classic means one extension on each natural lash for a defined look. Volume means a fan of several very fine lashes on each natural lash for a fuller look."}, {"q": "Are classic lashes good for beginners?", "a": "Yes. Most lash courses start with classic sets because they teach isolation, placement and glue control."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Classic lashes tray with rows of black lash extensions in a clear-lid case beside white flowers$j$),
