  ($j$qeelasee-clear-gel-remover$j$, $j$A clear, odour-free gel remover in a 15g bottle for taking off eyelash extensions. The gel stays where you put it on the lash and breaks down the glue, so the extensions slide off without harming the natural lashes. The supplier describes it as good for sensitive eyes.$j$, $j$["Clear, no smell", "Gel stays in place", "Gentle on natural lashes", "15g bottle"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Clear Gel Lash Remover 15g, No Smell | Kenya", "meta": "Clear gel remover, 15g: no-smell gel that dissolves eyelash extension glue without damaging natural lashes. Good for sensitive eyes. Kenya.", "keyword": "lash gel remover", "keywords": ["eyelash extension remover Kenya", "clear gel remover", "lash glue remover", "gel remover for sensitive eyes"], "alt": "Clear gel eyelash extension glue remover 15g bottle with white cap", "sections": [{"heading": "Safe removal, step by step", "body": "Protect the lower lashes with an under-eye pad and tape. Apply the remover to the bond area only, never near the waterline, and wait the time given. Slide the extensions off with a micro brush or tweezers without pulling, then cleanse the lashes with lash shampoo or a cleanser to take away any remover left behind."}, {"heading": "Tip", "body": "Have the client sitting up during removal, as the supplier advises, so any remover stays away from the eyes."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Gel lash glue remover"}, {"label": "Net weight", "value": "15g"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Clear"}, {"label": "Smell", "value": "None (supplier)"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash gel remover in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash gel remover here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is gel remover in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Is gel or liquid remover better?", "a": "Gel stays where you place it and is less likely to run into the eye, which makes it the safer choice for most removals."}, {"q": "How long does gel remover take?", "a": "Usually a few minutes on the bond; wait until the extensions slide off without pulling."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Clear gel eyelash extension glue remover 15g bottle with white cap$j$),
