  ($j$easy-fan-lashes$j$, $j$Easy fan lash trays for quick volume work. Press your tweezers on the line, lift, and the lashes bloom into an even fan, so you spend less time fanning and more time placing. Great for busy salons and for artists who are new to volume.$j$, $j$["Blooms into an even fan with one press", "Faster volume and hybrid sets", "Beginner friendly"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Easy Fan Lashes Trays for Fast Volume | Kenya", "meta": "Easy fan lash trays that bloom into even fans with one press, for faster volume and hybrid sets. Order easy fan lashes at wholesale prices in Kenya.", "keyword": "easy fan lash trays", "keywords": ["easy fan lashes Kenya", "blooming lashes", "self fanning lashes", "volume lash trays Nairobi", "lash supplies Kenya"], "alt": "Four easy fan lash trays with black lashes laid out on a white surface", "sections": [{"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Lash technicians who want faster volume appointments, beginners moving from classic to volume, and salons offering hybrid sets every day."}, {"heading": "How to use", "body": "Peel a strip, rest it on your lash tile, touch the tips of your volume tweezers to the line, press, slide and lift. Grab more lashes for a fuller fan, dip the base in glue and place on one natural lash."}, {"heading": "Before you order", "body": "Tell us the thickness, curl and length you need when you order, or message us to choose. For the full set of options on the page, see our Easy Fanning Lash trays."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Easy fan (blooming) lash extensions"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Black"}, {"label": "Packaging", "value": "Branded trays"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy easy fan lash trays in Kenya?", "a": "Order easy fan lash trays here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much are easy fan lashes in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "What are easy fan lashes?", "a": "Lashes lightly bonded at the base so they spread into a fan when pressed, instead of being fanned by hand."}, {"q": "Are they the same as premade fans?", "a": "No. Premade fans are already fixed into fans. Easy fan lashes let you choose how many lashes per fan."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Four easy fan lash trays with black lashes laid out on a white surface$j$),
  ($j$qeelasee-easy-fanning-lash$j$, $j$Easy fan lashes, also called blooming or self-fanning lashes, open into an even fan when you press and lift them with your tweezers. That makes volume sets much faster and is the easiest way for newer artists to start offering volume. Choose 0.03mm, 0.05mm or 0.07mm, curls C to DD, and lengths from 8mm to 25mm.$j$, $j$["Opens into a fan with one press", "0.03, 0.05 and 0.07mm", "C, CC, D and DD curls", "8-25mm, single or two lengths per line"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Easy Fan Lashes 0.03-0.07mm, Blooming Lashes | Kenya", "meta": "Easy fan (blooming) lashes that open into a fan with one press. 0.03-0.07mm, C to DD curl, 8-25mm. Faster volume sets. Wholesale in Kenya.", "keyword": "easy fan lashes", "keywords": ["easy fan lashes Kenya", "self fanning lashes", "blooming lashes", "rapid fan lashes", "auto fan lashes", "volume lashes for beginners"], "alt": "Easy fan lashes tray with a fan bloomed open between tweezers and a 12mm-14mm length label", "sections": [{"heading": "How easy fan lashes work", "body": "The lashes in each line are lightly bonded at the base. Touch the tips of your tweezers to the line, press and slide, and a fan blooms open. Choose how many lashes to grab for 3D to 10D fans and more."}, {"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Beginners learning volume, busy salons that want faster appointments, and classic artists adding volume to their menu without months of fanning practice."}, {"heading": "Tray layouts", "body": "Choose single length per line, or two lengths mixed in each line for built-in texture."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Easy fan (blooming) lash extensions"}, {"label": "Thickness", "value": "0.03mm, 0.05mm, 0.07mm"}, {"label": "Curl", "value": "C, CC, D, DD"}, {"label": "Length", "value": "8mm to 25mm single lengths, plus mixed 8-15mm trays"}, {"label": "Tray layout", "value": "Single length per line or 2 lengths mixed per line"}, {"label": "Fibre", "value": "PBT synthetic fibre from Korea, matte"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Black"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy easy fan lashes in Kenya?", "a": "Order easy fan lashes here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much are easy fan lashes in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Are easy fan lashes good for beginners?", "a": "Yes. They are the quickest way to make even fans while you are still learning to hand-make them."}, {"q": "Which thickness should I choose?", "a": "0.07mm for 3D-5D and hybrids, 0.05mm for 5D-8D, 0.03mm for mega volume."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Easy fan lashes tray with a fan bloomed open between tweezers and a 12mm-14mm length label$j$),
