  ($j$qeelasee-expert-glue-0606$j$, $j$Expert Glue 0606 is a professional-level lash adhesive with a 0.5 second drying time and about 8 weeks retention on the label (8-9 weeks in the supplier listing). It is a dependable everyday glue for classic, hybrid and volume. 5ml.$j$, $j$["0.5s drying time", "About 8 weeks retention", "Professional level", "5ml"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Expert Lash Glue 0606, 0.5s Dry, 8 Weeks, 5ml | Kenya", "meta": "Professional-level Expert Glue 0606: 0.5s drying, about 8 weeks retention, 5ml. For classic, hybrid and volume sets. Wholesale lash glue in Kenya.", "keyword": "expert lash glue", "keywords": ["professional lash glue", "0.5s eyelash glue", "lash extension adhesive", "black lash glue", "lash glue Kenya", "eyelash extension glue price in Kenya"], "alt": "Expert Glue 0606 lash glue bottle, 5ml, dry time 0.5s, retention 8 weeks", "sections": [{"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Working lash techs who want one reliable glue for most sets."}, {"heading": "Choosing a drying speed", "body": "The faster a glue dries, the less time you have to place and adjust each lash, so very fast glues suit experienced volume artists and slower glues suit beginners and classic work. Humidity changes drying speed too: lash glue sets faster in humid air and slower in dry air, which is why many artists in Nairobi keep two glues for the dry and rainy seasons."}, {"heading": "Storing your glue", "body": "Keep the bottle tightly closed in a cool, dry place; the supplier recommends 3-7°C, such as a fridge, for unopened bottles. Take it out about 20 minutes before use so it reaches room temperature, shake well, and wipe the nozzle clean before closing. Unopened glue keeps about a year; once opened, use it within 1-3 months for the best bond."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and