  ($j$qeelasee-glue-primer$j$, $j$A 15ml glue primer for eyelash extensions. It is a helper for your adhesive: it helps the glue bond more strongly and dry faster, so extensions stay on longer. It is especially useful in dry weather, when glue cures slowly.$j$, $j$["Helps glue bond stronger", "Faster glue drying", "Longer retention", "15ml bottle"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Lash Glue Primer 15ml for Better Retention | Kenya", "meta": "Lash glue primer, 15ml: helps lash glue grip and dry faster for stronger, longer-lasting extensions. Wholesale lash primer in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash glue primer", "keywords": ["eyelash extension primer Kenya", "lash primer", "primer for lash extensions", "retention booster", "glue booster lash"], "alt": "Lash glue primer 15ml bottle with white cap next to a lash tray and micro brush", "sections": [{"heading": "How to use", "body": "After cleansing and drying the natural lashes, apply a little primer to the base area with a micro brush and let it dry before you start. Keep the primer bottle closed and away from your glue: never mix or store them together, because primer makes glue harden."}, {"heading": "Where it fits in your prep", "body": "A good lash prep goes: cleanse with lash shampoo, rinse and dry, then protein remover or primer on the natural lashes, then glue. Clean, oil-free lashes are the biggest single factor in retention, especially on oily skin and in humid weather."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Lash glue primer"}, {"label": "Volume", "value": "15ml"}, {"label": "Use", "value": "Before lash application, on the natural lash base"}, {"label": "Storage", "value": "Separate from glue, cap closed"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash glue primer in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash glue primer here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is lash primer in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Do I need a primer for lash extensions?", "a": "Not every time, but it helps on oily lashes and in dry weather, when glue cures slowly and retention suffers."}, {"q": "Is primer the same as protein remover?", "a": "No. Protein remover cleans oil and protein off the lashes; primer helps the glue grip and cure. Many artists use both."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Lash glue primer 15ml bottle with white cap next to a lash tray and micro brush$j$),
  ($j$qeelasee-heart-star-comic-spire-lashes$j$, $j$Heart & Star Comic lashes are premade "anime" or comic-style lash extensions: soft fans gathered into bold spikes that create the doll-eye, manga look trending on social media. This version adds a playful heart and star look to the spikes, as shown in the sample line. They are 0.05mm black lashes, C, CC or D curl, with mixed 8-15mm lengths in one tray.$j$, $j$["Premade anime / comic spikes", "0.05mm black", "C, CC or D curl", "Mixed 8-15mm tray"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Heart & Star Comic Lashes, Anime Effect 0.05mm | Kenya", "meta": "Heart & Star Comic anime-effect lash extensions: premade comic spikes for doll-eye and manga looks. 0.05mm, C, CC or D curl, mixed 8-15mm. Kenya.", "keyword": "heart & star comic lashes", "keywords": ["anime lashes Kenya", "comic lashes", "manga lashes", "spiky anime lash extensions", "doll eye lashes", "premade spike lashes"], "alt": "Heart & Star Comic anime effect lash extensions tray with premade comic spikes and a close-up of the spike style", "sections": [{"heading": "How to style anime lashes", "body": "Lay a natural base of classic or light volume, then place the comic spikes evenly across the lash line, longest at the outer corners or centre depending on the eye shape. Many artists add short bottom spikes to complete the doll-eye look."}, {"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Artists who want trending, photo-ready styles on their menu, and clients who want a bold, playful look for events and content."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by