  ($j$i-g-tech-full-kit$j$, $j$The I-G Tech Full Kit is the professional kit for Infinity Glow UV lash extensions, with the light, glue, eye pads and safety glasses. UV lash glue stays liquid until the lamp shines on it, then cures into a flexible bond in about 1.5 seconds, so you place each lash at your own pace and the bond does not depend on the weather.$j$, $j$["Lamp, glue, eye pads and safety glasses", "Glue cures in about 1.5s under UV", "Work at your own pace", "Bond does not depend on humidity"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "I-G Tech Full Kit: UV Lash Lamp, Glue and Glasses | Kenya", "meta": "I-G Tech Full Kit for UV lash extensions: lamp, glue, eye pads and safety glasses. Glue cures in about 1.5s under the lamp. Kenya.", "keyword": "UV lash kit", "keywords": ["UV lash extension kit Kenya", "UV lash lamp kit", "I-G Tech kit", "UV lashes Nairobi", "UV lash glue kit"], "alt": "I-G Tech full UV lash extension kit with lamp, glue, eye pads and safety glasses", "sections": [{"heading": "How UV lash extensions work", "body": "Normal lash glue cures with moisture in the air, so the room decides how fast it dries. UV glue is cured by light: you place the lash, check it, and only flash the lamp when you are happy. The bond is set in about 1.5 seconds and gives off almost no fumes afterwards."}, {"heading": "Safety", "body": "Always wear the UV safety glasses, cover the client's eyes with the eye pads and aim the lamp at the lash base only. Store the glue in its blackout bag, away from windows, because daylight will start to cure it. UV lashes are not suitable for clients on light-sensitising medication such as Roaccutane, or with lupus or light-triggered epilepsy."}, {"heading": "Learn the method", "body": "Our Infinity Glow Mastery course on the Lashtribe Academy teaches the full UV technique, safety rules and how to price the service."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "UV lash extension kit"}, {"label": "Includes", "value": "Light, glue, eye pad and glasses (per product description)"}, {"label": "Cure time", "value": "About 1.5 seconds under the lamp"}, {"label": "Glue storage", "value": "Blackout bag, away from daylight"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy UV lash kit in Kenya?", "a": "Order UV lash kit here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is the I-G Tech Full Kit in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "How long do UV lash extensions last?", "a": "Our Infinity Glow course teaches 4-6 weeks retention with correct prep and aftercare."}, {"q": "Do I need training for UV lashes?", "a": "Yes. UV lashes need safe lamp handling; our Infinity Glow Mastery course covers it."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$I-G Tech full UV lash extension kit with lamp, glue, eye pads and safety glasses$j$),
  ($j$i-g-tech-glue-10ml$j$, $j$I-G Tech Glue is the professional lash adhesive in our Infinity Glow (I-G) range, in a 10ml bottle. It is a fast-drying black glue made for long-lasting retention on classic, hybrid and volume sets.$j$, $j$["Professional lash adhesive", "Fast drying, black", "10ml bottle"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "I-G Tech Lash Glue 10ml, Fast Drying | Kenya", "meta": "I-G Tech professional lash glue in a 10ml bottle: fast drying black adhesive for long-lasting retention on classic and volume sets. Kenya.", "keyword": "I-G Tech lash glue 10ml", "keywords": ["infinity glow glue", "professional lash glue", "fast drying lash glue", "lash glue 10ml", "lash glue Kenya", "eyelash extension glue price in Kenya"], "alt": "I-G Tech lash glue 10ml black bottle", "sections": [{"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Professional lash techs, especially those using the Infinity Glow range and kit."}, {"heading": "Choosing a drying speed", "body": "The faster a glue dries, the less time you have to place and adjust each lash, so very fast glues suit experienced volume artists and slower glues suit beginners and classic work. Humidity changes drying speed too: lash glue sets faster in humid air and slower in dry air, which is why many artists in Nairobi keep two glues for the dry and rainy seasons."}, {"heading": "Storing your glue", "body": "Keep the bottle tightly closed in a cool, dry place; the supplier recommends 3-7°C, such as a fridge, for unopened bottles. Take it out about 20 minutes before use so it reaches room temperature, shake well, and wipe the nozzle clean before closing. Unopened glue keeps about a year; once opened, use it within 1-3 months for the best bond."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Volume", "value": "10ml"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Black"}, {"label": "Use", "value": "Professional lash extensions"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy I-G Tech lash glue 10ml in Kenya?", "a": "Order I-G Tech lash glue 10ml here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is I-G Tech lash glue 10ml in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Is it safe for sensitive eyes?", "a": "Lash glue contains cyanoacrylate and gives off fumes while it cures. The supplier recommends it for clients without sensitive skin. Do a patch test with new clients, keep the client's eyes closed and use a fan to clear fumes."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$I-G Tech lash glue 10ml black bottle$j$),
