  ($j$qeelasee-lash-check-mirror$j$, $j$A stainless steel lash mirror on a long handle, like a dental mirror. Slide it under the lashes to see the underside of the set and check that no two lashes are stuck together, the most common cause of discomfort and poor retention. Sold as a pack of 2.$j$, $j$["Stainless steel handle", "See under the lash set", "Catch stickies before the client leaves", "Pack of 2"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Lash Check Mirror, Stainless Steel, 2pcs | Kenya", "meta": "Stainless steel lash check mirror for seeing under and between lashes, so no lashes are stuck together. Wholesale lash mirrors in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash check mirror", "keywords": ["lash check mirror Kenya", "dental mirror for lashes", "lash inspection mirror", "stainless lash mirror"], "alt": "Stainless steel lash check mirror reflecting lash extensions", "sections": [{"heading": "How to use", "body": "At the end of the set, hold the mirror just under the lash line and look at the reflection to check each extension is attached to one natural lash. Separate any stuck lashes before the glue cures fully. Disinfect the mirror between clients."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Material", "value": "Stainless steel and mirror"}, {"label": "Pack", "value": "2 pieces"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash check mirror in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash check mirror here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pe