  ($j$lash-gel-remover-10g$j$, $j$A gentle pink lash gel remover (10g) for safe lash extension removal. Gel removers stay where you apply them on the bond, so they are less likely to run towards the eye, and they dissolve the glue so extensions slide off without stressing the natural lashes.$j$, $j$["Gentle gel formula", "Pink gel, easy to see on the lash", "Safe extension removal"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Pink Lash Gel Remover 10g for Extensions | Kenya", "meta": "Gentle pink 10g lash gel remover for safe eyelash extension removal, in a pump-style bottle. Order lash gel remover in Kenya at wholesale prices.", "keyword": "lash gel remover 10g", "keywords": ["eyelash extension remover Kenya", "pink gel remover", "lash glue remover Nairobi", "gentle lash remover"], "alt": "Pink gel lash remover bottle next to its white box", "sections": [{"heading": "Safe removal, step by step", "body": "Protect the lower lashes with an under-eye pad and tape. Apply the remover to the bond area only, never near the waterline, and wait the time given. Slide the extensions off with a micro brush or tweezers without pulling, then cleanse the lashes with lash shampoo or a cleanser to take away any remover left behind."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Gel lash glue remover"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Pink gel"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash gel remover 10g in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash gel remover 10g here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is lash gel remover in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Is gel remover safe?", "a": "Used on the bond only, with the client's eyes closed and lower lashes protected, it is the gentlest common way to remove extensions."}, {"q": "How much remover do I need?", "a": "A thin layer on the bond area is enough."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Pink gel lash remover bottle next to its white box$j$),
