uch is lash serum in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Can I use lash serum with extensions?", "a": "Check the product directions; some serums contain oils that weaken lash glue."}, {"q": "How long until results show?", "a": "It depends on the formula and the person. Follow the pack directions and use it consistently."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Lash serum for natural lash care$j$),
  ($j$lash-shampoo-60ml$j$, $j$A 60ml foaming lash shampoo in a pump bottle. One pump gives a light mousse that lifts makeup, oil and residue from the lashes and lash line. Use it in the salon to prep clean lashes before a set, and sell it to clients as their home aftercare cleanser.$j$, $j$["Foaming mousse pump", "Cleans makeup, oil and residue", "Salon prep and home aftercare", "60ml bottle"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Lash Shampoo 60ml Foam Cleanser | Kenya", "meta": "60ml foaming lash shampoo that cleans makeup, oil and residue from natural lashes and extensions. For salon prep and client aftercare. Kenya.", "keyword": "lash shampoo", "keywords": ["lash shampoo Kenya", "eyelash extension cleanser", "lash foam cleanser", "lash cleansing mousse", "lash aftercare"], "alt": "60ml foaming lash shampoo pump bottle labelled Clean Mousse Eyelash Extension", "sections": [{"heading": "How to use", "body": "Pump a small amount of foam onto a clean lash brush, brush gently along the lashes and lash line with the eyes closed, then rinse with water and pat dry. Brush the lashes into place with a clean spoolie."}, {"heading": "Why clients need it", "body": "Oil and dirt break down lash glue and can build up along the lash line. Washing the lashes every day or two keeps extensions on longer and the eyes comfortable."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Foaming lash shampoo (mousse)"}, {"label": "Vol