  ($j$lash-tape$j$, $j$Breathable pink lash tape for securing and isolating lashes during extensions. Use it to hold the lower lashes down, lift hooded lids and tape away stray lashes.$j$, $j$["Breathable pink tape", "Securing and isolating lashes", "Easy to tear"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Breathable Pink Lash Tape for Extensions | Kenya", "meta": "Breathable pink lash tape for securing and isolating lashes during extensions. Soft on skin and easy to tear. Wholesale lash tape in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash tape", "keywords": ["lash tape Kenya", "under eye tape for lash extensions", "eyelash extension tape", "micropore tape for lashes", "lash supplies Nairobi"], "alt": "Rolls of breathable pink lash tape stacked on a white background", "sections": [{"heading": "How lash artists use tape", "body": "Tape the lower lashes down so they do not get glued to the top set, lift the eyelid skin on hooded eyes, and tape away stray lashes or sections you are not working on. Tear a short strip, fold the end for an easy pull, and apply it without pressing on the eye."}, {"heading": "Comfort tips", "body": "Use the gentlest tape that holds, keep it away from the waterline and peel it off slowly towards the outer corner."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Breathable lash tape"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Pink"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash tape in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash tape here on La