  ($j$qeelasee-lower-flat-bottom-lashes$j$, $j$Short ellipse (flat) lashes for the lower lash line, with double split tips for a soft, feathered end. They give a darker, more defined bottom line than round lashes of the same weight. Choose 6mm or 7mm, 0.15mm or 0.20mm thick, in J or C curl.$j$, $j$["Flat lower lashes with double split tips", "6mm and 7mm lengths", "0.15 and 0.20mm", "J and C curl"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Flat Bottom Lashes 6-7mm, Split Tips | Kenya", "meta": "Flat bottom lashes for the lower lash line, 6 or 7mm, 0.15 or 0.20mm, J or C curl, with double split tips. Wholesale lower lashes in Kenya.", "keyword": "flat bottom lashes", "keywords": ["lower lash extensions Kenya", "bottom flat lashes", "split tip bottom lashes", "6mm lashes", "under lash extensions"], "alt": "Flat bottom lashes tray with short black lashes and a close-up of the double split tips", "sections": [{"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Artists who add bottom lashes to their sets for a defined lower line, and clients who want lower lash definition without daily eyeliner or mascara."}, {"heading": "Tips", "body": "Keep the lower lash glue dot very small, use the 0.15mm on fine lower lashes, and tape the upper lashes out of the way. Lower lash extensions usually need refilling sooner than the top set."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Flat (ellipse) lower lash extensions, double split tips"}, {"l