  ($j$qeelasee-luxury-comic-spire-lashes$j$, $j$Luxury Comic Spire lashes are premade "anime" or comic-style lash extensions: soft fans gathered into bold spikes that create the doll-eye, manga look trending on social media. The Luxury Comic Spire style forms long, sharp spikes. They are 0.05mm black lashes, C or D curl, with mixed 8-15mm lengths in one tray.$j$, $j$["Premade anime / comic spikes", "0.05mm black", "C or D curl", "Mixed 8-15mm tray"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Luxury Comic Spire Lashes, Anime Effect 0.05mm | Kenya", "meta": "Luxury Comic Spire anime-effect lash extensions: premade comic spikes for doll-eye and manga looks. 0.05mm, C or D curl, mixed 8-15mm. Kenya.", "keyword": "luxury comic spire lashes", "keywords": ["anime lashes Kenya", "comic lashes", "manga lashes", "spiky anime lash extensions", "doll eye lashes", "premade spike lashes"], "alt": "Luxury Comic Spire anime effect lash extensions tray with premade comic spikes and a close-up of the spike style", "sections": [{"heading": "How to style anime lashes", "body": "Lay a natural base of classic or light volume, then place the comic spikes evenly across the lash line, longest at the outer corners or centre depending on the eye shape. Many artists add short bottom spikes to complete the doll-eye look."}, {"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Artists who want trending, photo-ready styles on their menu, and clients who want a bold, playful look for events and content."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as yo