  ($j$qeelasee-mild-glue-0507$j$, $j$Mild Glue 0507 is a long lasting eyelash extension glue that sets in about 0.5 seconds. It is a balanced choice for classic and hybrid work. The bottle label rates retention at 6-8 weeks and the supplier listing at 8-9 weeks.$j$, $j$["0.5s drying time", "Long lasting", "6-9 weeks retention", "Classic and hybrid sets"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Mild Lash Glue 0507, 0.5s, Long Lasting | Kenya", "meta": "Mild Glue 0507: a 0.5s, long lasting eyelash extension glue for classic and hybrid sets, 6-9 weeks retention. Wholesale mild lash glue in Kenya.", "keyword": "mild lash glue", "keywords": ["long lasting lash glue", "0.5s eyelash glue", "lash glue for classic", "mild eyelash adhesive", "lash glue Kenya", "eyelash extension glue price in Kenya"], "alt": "Mild Glue 0507 eyelash glue bottle, 10ml, dry time 0.5s", "sections": [{"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Artists who want a dependable, not-too-fast glue for classic and hybrid sets."}, {"heading": "Choosing a drying speed", "body": "The faster a glue dries, the less time you have to place and adjust each lash, so very fast glues suit experienced volume artists and slower glues suit beginners and classic work. Humidity changes drying speed too: lash glue sets faster in humid air and slower in dry air, which is why many artists in Nairobi keep two glues for the dry and rainy seasons."}, {"heading": "Storing your glue", "body": "Keep the bottle tightly closed in a cool, dry place; the supplier recommends 3-7°C, such as a fridge, for unopened bottles. Take it out about 20 minutes before use so it reaches room temperature, shake well, and wipe the nozzle clean before closing. Unopened glue keeps about a year; once opened, use it within 1-3 months for the best bond."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the 