  ($j$qeelasee-mini-air-blower$j$, $j$A hand-squeeze mini air blower made of silicone. A few puffs over the finished lashes help the glue set and blow away fumes, so the client is comfortable when they open their eyes. No battery or charging needed. Choose pink, black or red.$j$, $j$["Hand-squeeze, no battery", "Helps glue set, clears fumes", "Silicone", "Pink, black or red"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Mini Air Blower for Drying Lash Glue | Kenya", "meta": "Mini silicone air blower to set lash glue faster and blow away fumes, in pink, black or red. No battery needed. Wholesale in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash air blower", "keywords": ["lash blower Kenya", "mini air blower for lashes", "lash dryer", "glue drying blower"], "alt": "Mini air blowers for lash extensions in pink, black and red silicone", "sections": [{"heading": "How to use", "body": "Squeeze gently a few centimetres from the lashes, with the client's eyes closed, after each section or at the end of the set. It can also be used to blow dust off tools."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Hand-squeeze air blower"}, {"label": "Material", "value": "Silicone"}, {"label": "Colours", "value": "Pink, Black, Red"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash air blower in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash air blower here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We