  ($j$mirror$j$, $j$A stainless steel lash mirror on a long handle, like a dental mirror. Slide it under the lashes to see the underside of the set and check that no two lashes are stuck together, the most common cause of discomfort and poor retention.$j$, $j$["Stainless steel handle", "See under the lash set", "Catch stickies before the client leaves"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Lash Mirror for Checking Extensions | Kenya", "meta": "Stainless steel lash check mirror for seeing under and between lashes, so no lashes are stuck together. Wholesale lash mirrors in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash mirror", "keywords": ["lash check mirror Kenya", "dental mirror for lashes", "lash inspection mirror", "stainless lash mirror"], "alt": "Stainless steel lash check mirror reflecting lash extensions", "sections": [{"heading": "How to use", "body": "At the end of the set, hold the mirror just under the lash line and look at the reflection to check each extension is attached to one natural lash. Separate any stuck lashes before the glue cures fully. Disinfect the mirror between clients."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Material", "value": "Stainless steel and mirror"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash mirror in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash mirror here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is a lash mirror in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Why check lashes with a mirror?", "a": "Stuck lashes (stickies) pull on the natural lashes as they grow and cause discomfort and early fall-out. A mirror shows them clearly."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Stainless steel lash check mirror reflecting lash extensions$j$),
  ($j$moonlight$j$, $j$A floor-standing half moon lash lamp. The curved arc of light sits over the client's face and lights both eyes evenly without harsh shadows, so you can see every natural lash for neat isolation. Shown in black and pink.$j$, $j$["Half moon arc light", "Even light over both eyes", "Floor standing", "Black or pink"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Half Moon Lash Lamp, Floor Standing LED | Kenya", "meta": "Floor-standing half moon lash lamp that lights the lash line evenly for detailed lash work. Black or pink. Order a lash lamp in Kenya.", "keyword": "half moon lash lamp", "keywords": ["lash lamp Kenya", "moon light lash lamp", "LED lash light", "eyelash extension lamp", "beauty lamp Nairobi"], "alt": "Half moon lash lamps in black and pink, floor standing in a studio", "sections": [{"heading": "Why a moon lamp", "body": "Good light is the difference between clean isolation and stickies. The arc shape wraps light around the eye area, so shadows from your hands and tools do not hide the lashes. It also makes your studio photos look professional."}, {"heading": "Setting up", "body": "Stand the lamp at the head of the lash bed and adjust the arc so it sits above the client's face, not shining into their eyes."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Half moon floor lamp for lash and beauty work"}, {"label": "Colours", "value": "Black, Pink (as pictured)"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where 