  ($j$qeelasee-premade-fans-6d-short-stem$j$, $j$6D premade fans with short, thin stems, ready to pick and place. Each tray holds 15 fans in each of 12 lines, 180 fans in total, so you can do a full volume set without hand-making a single fan. The fans are 0.07mm, C or D curl, in single lengths from 8mm to 15mm or a mixed tray.$j$, $j$["180 fans per tray (15 x 12 lines)", "6D fans with short stems", "0.07mm, C and D curl", "8-15mm or mixed tray"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "6D Premade Fans Short Stem 0.07mm, 180 Fans | Kenya", "meta": "6D premade volume fans with short stems: 15 fans x 12 lines (180 fans) per tray, 0.07mm, C or D curl, 8-15mm. Wholesale premade fans Kenya.", "keyword": "6D premade fans", "keywords": ["premade fans Kenya", "premade volume fans", "short stem premade fans", "6D volume lashes", "pre made lash fans"], "alt": "6D premade fans tray with 12 lines of short-stem fans and a close-up of one 6D fan", "sections": [{"heading": "Short stem vs long stem", "body": "A short stem means the fibres open close to the base, giving a full, fluffy fan with a neat, small base on the natural lash. It is the most popular choice for dense, dark volume."}, {"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Busy salons, artists offering volume without hand-fanning, and anyone who wants consistent fans set after set."}, {"heading": "Application", "body": "Lift a fan by its stem, dip just the stem in glue and place it on one isolated natural lash. Wipe the stem on the glue edge if too much is picked up."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by wei