  ($j$primer$j$, $j$A lash primer to pre-treat natural lashes before extensions. It leaves the lashes clean and oil-free so the glue bonds properly, which is one of the simplest ways to improve retention. It comes in a white bottle with a fine tip, packed in a resealable pouch.$j$, $j$["Pre-treats natural lashes", "Removes oil before glue", "Better retention", "Fine-tip bottle"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Lash Primer for Eyelash Extensions | Kenya", "meta": "Lash primer that leaves natural lashes clean and oil-free before extensions, for a stronger bond and better retention. Order in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash primer", "keywords": ["eyelash extension primer Kenya", "lash prep primer", "primer for lash extensions Nairobi", "retention primer"], "alt": "Lash primer bottle with white cap and red tip in a clear resealable pouch", "sections": [{"heading": "How to use", "body": "Cleanse the lashes, dry them, then apply a little primer along the natural lashes with a micro brush. Let it dry fully before you start placing extensions."}, {"heading": "Where it fits in your prep", "body": "A good lash prep goes: cleanse with lash shampoo, rinse and dry, then protein remover or primer on the natural lashes, then glue. Clean, oil-free lashes are the biggest single factor in retention, especially on oily skin and in humid weather."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Lash primer (pre-treatment)"}, {"label": "Packaging", "value": "White fine-tip bottle in a resealable pouch"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash primer in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash primer here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is lash primer in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "When do I apply primer?", "a": "After cleansing and before the first extension, on dry lashes."}, {"q": "Does primer make lashes last longer?", "a": "Clean, oil-free lashes bond better, so primer helps retention, together with good glue and aftercare."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Lash primer bottle with white cap and red tip in a clear resealable pouch$j$),
  ($j$qeelasee-protein-remover$j$, $j$A green tea protein remover (lash primer) in a 15ml bottle. Natural lashes carry oil, protein and dust that stop glue bonding properly. This cleanser takes them off the lashes before you start, so the adhesive grips better and extensions last longer.$j$, $j$["Removes oil, protein and dust", "Green tea extract", "Boosts glue bond and retention", "15ml bottle"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Lash Protein Remover, Green Tea, 15ml | Kenya", "meta": "Green tea protein remover, 15ml: cleans oil, protein and dust off natural lashes before extensions for a stronger glue bond. Wholesale in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash protein remover", "keywords": ["lash protein remover Kenya", "green tea lash primer", "lash prep", "lash cleanser before extensions"], "alt": "Green tea protein remover 15ml bottle with green cap and an eye with lash extensions", "sections": [{"heading": "How to use", "body": "Do not apply straight from the bottle. Put a small drop onto a cotton swab, cotton pad or micro applicator and wipe it along the natural lashes, then let them dry before applying extensions. Use it on natural lashes only."}, {"heading": "Where it fits in your prep", "body": "A good lash prep goes: cleanse with lash shampoo, rinse and dry, then protein remover or primer on the natural lashes, then glue. Clean, oil-free lashes are the biggest single factor in retention, especially on oily skin and in humid weather."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Protein remover / lash primer"}, {"label": "Volume", "value": "15ml"}, {"label": "Ingredients", "value": "Water, cetylpyridinium chloride, surfactant, green tea extract (supplier)"}, {"label": "Use", "value": "On natural lashes before extensions"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash protein remover in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash protein remover here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is protein remover in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "What does a protein remover do?", "a": "It cleans natural oils, protein and dust off the lashes so the glue bonds directly to the lash."}, {"q": "Can I use it on the extensions?", "a": "It is made for natural lashes before application."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Green tea protein remover 15ml bottle with green cap and an eye with lash extensions$j$),
