  ($j$qeelasee-spike-3d-w-lash-brown$j$, $j$A brown 3D W lash with a longer centre fibre that forms a spike, so every pick gives a soft fan with a built-in wispy point. It is a fast way to make brown wispy and textured volume sets. 0.07mm, C or D curl, 8mm to 15mm or a mixed tray.$j$, $j$["3D W fan with a centre spike", "Soft brown colour", "0.07mm, C and D curl", "8-15mm or mixed tray"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Brown Spike 3D-W Lash Extensions 0.07mm | Kenya", "meta": "Brown 3D W lashes with a longer spike in the middle for wispy, textured sets. 0.07mm, C or D curl, 8-15mm. Wholesale brown lashes in Kenya.", "keyword": "brown spike lashes", "keywords": ["3D W lashes brown", "spike lashes Kenya", "wispy W lashes", "brown wispy lashes", "dual core W lashes"], "alt": "Brown spike 3D W lash extensions tray with an eye in a brown wispy set and a W fan with a centre spike", "sections": [{"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Artists offering brown or 'natural wispy' sets, clients with lighter natural lashes, and anyone who wants spikes without placing separate spike lashes."}, {"heading": "Application", "body": "Pick by the base, dip lightly, and place so the spike points straight up from the natural lash. Mix with plain 3D W brown lashes for a softer pattern."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "3D W shape lashes with centre spike"}, {"label": "Thickness", "value": "0.07mm"}, {"label": "Curl