  ($j$qeelasee-spikes-lashes$j$, $j$Spike lash extensions are closed, pointed lashes that you place among fans to create the spiky, textured wispy look and the wet-look styles clients are asking for. These are 0.07mm in C or D curl, single lengths from 8mm to 18mm or a mixed tray.$j$, $j$["Closed spikes for wispy and wet looks", "0.07mm, C and D curl", "8-18mm or mixed tray"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Wispy Spike Lash Extensions 0.07mm | Kenya", "meta": "Wispy spike lash extensions, 0.07mm, C or D curl, 8-18mm or mixed tray. Build wet-look and wispy sets faster. Wholesale spike lashes in Kenya.", "keyword": "spike lash extensions", "keywords": ["wispy spikes lashes", "spikes lashes Kenya", "wet look lashes", "kim k lashes", "wispy lash extensions"], "alt": "Spike lash extensions tray with rows of closed spikes and an eye wearing a wispy spike set", "sections": [{"heading": "How spikes are used", "body": "Map the set, lay a base of classic or volume, then place longer spikes every few lashes to create peaks. For a wet look, use mostly spikes in a tight pattern for that 'just out of the water' effect."}, {"heading": "Tips", "body": "Spikes look best a few millimetres longer than the base layer. Keep them evenly spaced and check the pattern from the front before you finish."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Spike (closed) lash extensions"}, {"label": "Thickness", "value": "0.07mm"}, {"label": "Curl", "value": "C, D"}, {"label": "Length", "value": "8mm to 18mm single lengths, plus mixed 8-15mm trays"}, {"label": "Fibre", "value": "PBT synthetic fibre from Korea"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "Black"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy spike lash extensions in Kenya?", "a": "Order spike lash extensions here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much are spike lashes in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "What is a wispy lash set?", "a": "A set with longer spikes placed among a fuller base, giving uneven, textured peaks instead of a flat line."}, {"q": "Are spike lashes premade?", "a": "Yes, each spike is a ready-closed group, so you just pick and place."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Spike lash extensions tray with rows of closed spikes and an eye wearing a wispy spike set$j$),
  ($j$qeelasee-spire-anime-lashes$j$, $j$Spire Anime lashes are premade "anime" or comic-style lash extensions: soft fans gathered into bold spikes that create the doll-eye, manga look trending on social media. The Spire style makes tall, defined points. They are 0.05mm black lashes, C or D curl, with mixed 8-15mm lengths in one tray.$j$, $j$["Premade anime / comic spikes", "0.05mm black", "C or D curl", "Mixed 8-15mm tray"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Spire Anime Lashes, Anime Effect 0.05mm | Kenya", "meta": "Spire Anime anime-effect lash extensions: premade comic spikes for doll-eye and manga looks. 0.05mm, C or D curl, mixed 8-15mm. Kenya.", "keyword": "spire anime lashes", "keywords": ["anime lashes Kenya", "comic lashes", "manga lashes", "spiky anime lash extensions", "doll eye lashes", "premade spike lashes"], "alt": "Spire Anime anime effect lash extensions tray with premade comic spikes and a close-up of the spike style", "sections": [{"heading": "How to style anime lashes", "body": "Lay a natural base of classic or light volume, then place the comic spikes evenly across the lash line, longest at the outer corners or centre depending on the eye shape. Many artists add short bottom spikes to complete the doll-eye look."}, {"heading": "Who it suits", "body": "Artists who want trending, photo-ready styles on their menu, and clients who want a bold, playful look for events and content."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}],