  ($j$qeelasee-surgical-tape$j$, $j$Soft surgical tape for lash extensions, in a pack of 10 rolls. Use it to protect under the eye and hold the lower lashes down while you work on the top set.$j$, $j$["Soft surgical tape", "Under-eye protection", "10 rolls"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Surgical Tape for Lash Extensions, 10 Rolls | Kenya", "meta": "Soft surgical tape for lash extensions, 10 rolls: tape the lower lashes and protect under the eye during sets. Wholesale lash tape in Kenya.", "keyword": "surgical lash tape", "keywords": ["lash tape Kenya", "under eye tape for lash extensions", "eyelash extension tape", "micropore tape for lashes", "lash supplies Nairobi"], "alt": "White surgical tape rolls for lash extensions", "sections": [{"heading": "How lash artists use tape", "body": "Tape the lower lashes down so they do not get glued to the top set, lift the eyelid skin on hooded eyes, and tape away stray lashes or sections you are not working on. Tear a short strip, fold the end for an easy pull, and apply it without pressing on the eye."}, {"heading": "Comfort tips", "body": "Use the gentlest tape that holds, keep it away from the waterline and peel it off slowly towards the outer corner."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Surgical tape"}, {"label": "Pack", "value": "10 rolls"}, {"label": "Colour", "value": "White"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy surgical lash tape in Kenya?", "a": "Order surgical lash tape here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much is surgical tape for lashes in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Which tape is gentlest?", "a": "Micropore paper tape is the softest on skin; PE tape is clear and grips well; surgical cloth tape is strong and easy to tear."}, {"q": "Can tape replace under-eye pads?", "a": "Many artists use both: pads for comfort and tape to hold stray lashes."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$White surgical tape rolls for lash extensions$j$),
  ($j$qeelasee-pe-tape$j$, $j$Clear medical PE tape for lash extensions, in a pack of 10 rolls. It is breathable and easy to tear, and because it is transparent you can see the lashes under it as you tape.$j$, $j$["Transparent, see the lashes", "Breathable, easy to tear", "10 rolls"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Transparent PE Lash Tape, Breathable, 10 Rolls | Kenya", "meta": "Transparent PE lash tape, 10 rolls: breathable and easy to tear, lets you see the lashes underneath. Wholesale lash tape in Kenya.", "keyword": "transparent lash tape", "keywords": ["lash tape Kenya", "under eye tape for lash extensions", "eyelash extension tape", "micropore tape for lashes", "lash supplies Nairobi"], "alt": "Transparent PE tape roll for lash extensions", "sections": [{"heading": "How lash artists use tape", "body": "Tape the lower lashes down so they do not get glued to the top set, lift the eyelid skin on hooded eyes, and tape away stray lashes or sections you are not working on. Tear a short strip, fold the end for an easy pull, and apply it without pressing on the eye."}, {"heading": "Comfort tips", "body": "Use the gentlest tape that holds, keep it away from the waterline and peel it off slowly towards the outer corner."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Transparent PE medical tape"}, {"label": "Pack", "value": "10 rolls"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy transparent lash tape in Kenya?", "a"