  ($j$tweezers$j$, $j$Precision tweezers for professional lash application. Use them to isolate natural lashes and to pick up and place extensions.$j$, $j$["Precision tips", "For isolation and placement"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Precision Lash Tweezers for Extensions | Kenya", "meta": "Precision tweezers for professional lash application, for isolating and placing lash extensions. Order lash tweezers in Kenya.", "keyword": "lash tweezers", "keywords": ["precision tweezers", "isolation tweezers", "volume tweezers Nairobi", "lash tweezers Kenya", "eyelash extension tweezers"], "alt": "Precision lash tweezers", "sections": [{"heading": "Isolation or volume tweezers?", "body": "Isolation tweezers are long and straight or gently curved; you use them in your non-working hand to separate one natural lash. Volume tweezers have angled, L or boot shaped tips that let you pick up and open fans. Most artists keep one isolation tweezer and one or two volume tweezers."}, {"heading": "Caring for your tweezers", "body": "Wipe glue off the tips after every client and disinfect them between clients. Store them with tip covers on, and never drop them: a bent tip stops closing evenly, which ruins isolation and fanning."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Precision lash tweezers"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy lash tweezers in Kenya?", "a": "Order lash tweezers here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to you