  ($j$fadvan-ventilador-premade-fans-3d-20d$j$, $j$Handmade premade volume fans in every size from 3D to 20D, made from matte Korean silk fibre. The supplier says the fans hold their curl for about 12 months and are hypoallergenic and vegan. Choose 0.05mm or 0.07mm, curls C, CC, D or DD, and lengths from 8mm to 20mm, or a 12-line mixed tray.$j$, $j$["3D to 20D fan sizes", "Matte Korean silk, handmade", "0.05 or 0.07mm, C to DD", "8-20mm or 12-line mixed tray"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "Premade Volume Fans 3D-20D, 0.05/0.07mm | Kenya", "meta": "Handmade premade volume fans from 3D to 20D in matte Korean silk, 0.05 or 0.07mm, C to DD, 8-20mm. Hypoallergenic, vegan. Wholesale in Kenya.", "keyword": "premade volume fans", "keywords": ["premade fans Kenya", "premade volume fans", "10D premade fans", "mega volume premade fans", "handmade premade fans", "lash fans Nairobi"], "alt": "Premade volume fans tray with rows of handmade black fans in a white and pink tray", "sections": [{"heading": "Which fan size", "body": "3D-5D gives a light, natural volume. 6D-10D is the usual full volume. 12D and above is mega volume for strong natural lashes and bold looks. Higher D fans use finer fibres in practice, so check the natural lash can carry them."}, {"heading": "Why handmade premade fans", "body": "Each fan is made by hand with a thin, tidy base, so it looks like a fan you made yourself but saves you the time. Matte fibres look natural and less shiny than glossy lashes."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Type", "value": "Handmade premade volume fans"}, {"label": "Fan sizes", "value": "3D, 4D, 5D, 6D, 8D, 10D, 12D, 14D, 16D, 18D, 20D"}, {"label": "Thickness", "value": "0.05mm, 0.07mm"}, {"label": "Curl", "value": "C, D, CC, DD"}, {"label": "Length", "value": "8mm to 12 lines mix 8-14-15-20mm single lengths"}, {"label": "Fibre", "value": "Matte Korean silk (supplier)"}, {"label": "Curl retention", "value": "About 12 months (supplier)"}, {"label": "Other", "value": "Hypoallergenic, vegan (supplier)"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy premade volume fans in Kenya?", "a": "Order premade volume fans here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much are premade fans in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "What does 10D mean?", "a": "Ten lash fibres in one fan. The higher the number, the fuller and darker the fan."}, {"q": "Which thickness for 10D and above?", "a": "Fine fibres keep big fans light. Ask us to confirm the thickness available for the fan size you want."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$Premade volume fans tray with rows of handmade black fans in a white and pink tray$j$),
  ($j$vetus-golden-feather-dolphin-tweezers$j$, $j$Genuine VETUS volume tweezers in two popular shapes: Golden Feather and Dolphin. Both are stainless steel with an anti-static coating, so fine lashes do not jump to the tips. The supplier says each tweezer is tested for proper closure before it ships.$j$, $j$["Genuine VETUS", "Golden Feather or Dolphin shape", "Anti-static coating", "Each tested for closure (supplier)"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "VETUS Golden Feather and Dolphin Volume Tweezers | Kenya", "meta": "Genuine VETUS Golden Feather or Dolphin volume tweezers: stainless steel with anti-static coating, each checked before dispatch. Kenya.", "keyword": "VETUS volume tweezers", "keywords": ["vetus tweezers Kenya", "dolphin tweezers", "golden feather tweezers", "anti static lash tweezers", "lash tweezers Kenya", "eyelash extension tweezers"], "alt": "VETUS Golden Feather and Dolphin volume tweezers with a black leather case", "sections": [{"heading": "Choosing a shape", "body": "The Dolphin has a curved tip with a gentle bend that many artists use for volume and for isolating. The Golden Feather is a fine, angled volume tweezer for picking and closing fans. Choose by what feels natural in your hand."}, {"heading": "Isolation or volume tweezers?", "body": "Isolation tweezers are long and straight or gently curved; you use them in your non-working hand to separate one natural lash. Volume tweezers have angled, L or boot shaped tips that let you pick up and open fans. Most artists keep one isolation tweezer and one or two volume tweezers."}, {"heading": "Caring for your tweezers", "body": "Wipe glue off the tips after every client and disinfect them between clients. Store them with tip covers on, and never drop them: a bent tip stops closing evenly, which ruins isolation and fanning."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local shelf prices.\n\nBuy the minimum quantity shown on this page to get the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Pay by M-Pesa or card. Shipping to our office is worked out by weight at checkout, and we contact you as soon as your batch lands to arrange delivery to your salon."}], "specs": [{"label": "Brand", "value": "VETUS"}, {"label": "Models", "value": "Dolphin, Golden Feather"}, {"label": "Material", "value": "Stainless steel, anti-static coating"}, {"label": "Quantity", "value": "1 piece"}], "faqs": [{"q": "Where can I buy VETUS volume tweezers in Kenya?", "a": "Order VETUS volume tweezers here on Lashtribe Africa. Add it to your cart, pay by M-Pesa or card, and it ships with the next supplier batch to our office in Kenya. We contact you when it arrives to arrange delivery to your salon or home."}, {"q": "How much are VETUS volume tweezers in Kenya?", "a": "The price on this page is the live price. Order the minimum quantity for the wholesale price; smaller orders pay the retail price. Shipping is added by weight at checkout, so you see the full cost before you pay."}, {"q": "Are these genuine VETUS?", "a": "The supplier states they are genuine VETUS tweezers."}]}$j$::jsonb, $j$VETUS Golden Feather and Dolphin volume tweezers with a black leather case$j$),
