  ($j$vetus-tweezers-st$j$, $j$VETUS is one of the best-known tweezer brands in the lash industry. This is the ST series in polished stainless steel. Choose from ST-11, ST-12, ST-15, ST-17; the photo shows the tip shape of each model, from straight fine points to curved tips.$j$, $j$["VETUS ST series", "Models ST-11, ST-12, ST-15, ST-17", "Straight and curved tips"]$j$::jsonb, $j${"title": "VETUS ST Lash Tweezers ST-11+ | Kenya", "meta": "VETUS ST tweezers (ST-11, ST-12, ST-15, ST-17): precise tips for lash isolation and volume. Choose your model. Wholesale VETUS tweezers in Kenya.", "keyword": "VETUS ST tweezers", "keywords": ["vetus tweezers Kenya", "vetus lash tweezers", "straight and curved tweezers", "lash tweezers Kenya", "eyelash extension tweezers"], "alt": "VETUS ST lash tweezers set, models ST-11, ST-12, ST-15, ST-17", "sections": [{"heading": "Choosing a model", "body": "Straight models are the classic isolation tweezer. Curved models are used for isolation in awkward angles and for picking up lashes. Look at the photo for each model's tip, or message us and we will help you pick."}, {"heading": "Isolation or volume tweezers?", "body": "Isolation tweezers are long and straight or gently curved; you use them in your non-working hand to separate one natural lash. Volume tweezers have angled, L or boot shaped tips that let you pick up and open fans. Most artists keep one isolation tweezer and one or two volume tweezers."}, {"heading": "Caring for your tweezers", "body": "Wipe glue off the tips after every client and disinfect them between clients. Store them with tip covers on, and never drop them: a bent tip stops closing evenly, which ruins isolation and fanning."}, {"heading": "Ordering from Lashtribe Africa", "body": "Lashtribe Africa is a preorder wholesale shop for lash technicians in Kenya. Your order joins the next supplier shipping batch, which leaves around the middle and the end of every month, so you pay close to source prices instead of local sh